&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Strong ownership mindset, calm under pressure, and bias toward action.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
